<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves rise to 71.57 bln ringgit.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves rise to 71.57 bln ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves rose to 71.57 billion ringgit as at March 15 against 71.19 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement on Monday.  </p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities rose</p>
<p>to 96.59 billion ringgit from 95.15 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p>(In bln ringgit)  March 15 1997   Feb 28 1996    March 15 1996</p>
<p>Reserves		 71.57	     71.19	     63.76</p>
<p>Assets		   96.59	     95.15	     88.66</p>
<p>Currency		 22.38	     23.45	     20.10</p>
<p>Govt paper		1.78		1.65		2.85</p>
</text>
